/Title (To win in Minesweeper, only one objective must be achieved. That is to open or clear all the cells that do not contain bombs \(because the bombs are flagged\). Once this goal have been completed, the game is won. In order to achieve this goal users can flag all the cells that they think are mines on the board. Lastly, the is user should try to reveal all the non-mine cells in the shortest time possible.)
